**Kwa nini ni muhimu?** Faili hili linazuia Git kuhifadhi Python cache, local databases, secrets na build artifacts. Hasa `.env` haitakiwi kuingia Git kwa sababu itakuwa na database credentials na secret keys.

## Hatua ya 3 — Thibitisha `.gitignore`

Hifadhi faili, kisha endesha:

```powershell
Test-Path .\.gitignore
```

Tunatarajia `True`.

Kisha tuanze kusakinisha dependencies zetu:

```powershell
python -m pip install -e ".[dev]"
```

Hii itasoma `pyproject.toml` na kusakinisha FastAPI, Uvicorn, SQLAlchemy, PostgreSQL driver, Alembic, Pytest, HTTPX na Ruff.

<text color="secondary" size="sm">Usifunge PowerShell wakati installation inaendelea.</text>

**Nitumie output ya installation na `Test-Path`.** Kisha tunaingia moja kwa moja kwenye `backend/app/main.py` na kuanzisha API yetu ya kwanza.
